<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<ruleset name="Java 共通規範" xmlns="http://pmd.sourceforge.net/ruleset/2.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://pmd.sourceforge.net/ruleset/2.0.0 https://pmd.sourceforge.io/ruleset_2_0_0.xsd">
  <description>依 tools/java/rule-map.yml 建立；候選規則不在預設集合。</description>
  <!-- JV-LS-013 -->
  <rule name="ParallelStreamUsage" language="java" class="net.sourceforge.pmd.lang.rule.xpath.XPathRule" message="[JV-LS-013] 平行處理的採用條件 → rules/stacks/java/common/lambda-and-stream.md#java-parallel-stream-adoption" externalInfoUrl="https://github.com/clarkeforwork-coder/dev-rule/blob/main/rules/stacks/java/common/lambda-and-stream.md#java-parallel-stream-adoption">
    <description>本小節沒有規範範例，以合成範例實證（parallelStream() 與 stream().parallel() 各抓到一次，stream().count() 乾淨）；所有平行處理都會被報，已核准者須 @SuppressWarnings(&quot;PMD.ParallelStreamUsage&quot;) 並附量測依據，這正是條文要求的例外流程；；實證版本：17。</description>
    <priority>1</priority>
    <properties>
      <property name="xpath"><value><![CDATA[//MethodCall[(@MethodName = 'parallelStream' and *[1][pmd-java:typeIs('java.util.Collection')])
          or (@MethodName = 'parallel' and *[1][pmd-java:typeIs('java.util.stream.BaseStream')])]]]></value></property>
    </properties>
  </rule>
</ruleset>
